{"id":"n59872-1-7","stage":5,"title":"봉사자 · 志愿者","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59872-1-7-1","ko":"봉사자들의 대가 없는 노력으로 큰 행사를 무사히 마칠 수 있었어요.","zh":"多亏了志愿者们无私的付出，我们才能顺利举办完这场大型活动。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"봉사자들의","meaning":"志愿者，义工","explanation":"봉사자：志愿者，义工；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"봉사자","audio":"/audio/29e55caf23ce1fc322e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59872","senseId":"1","lemma":"봉사자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봉사자들의","audio":"/audio/6c3e982b89bb60545444.mp3"}},{"text":"대가","meaning":"回报","explanation":"대가：回报","readings":[{"term":"대가","audio":"/audio/09decfebbdb1b0f10aa7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14261","senseId":"2","lemma":"대가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대가","audio":"/audio/09decfebbdb1b0f10aa7.mp3"}},{"text":"없는","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없는","audio":"/audio/9064a5c0bfdea4101ee3.mp3"}},{"text":"노력으로","meaning":"努力，下工夫","explanation":"노력：努力，下工夫；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"노력","audio":"/audio/1119b060db74766fb336.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62400","senseId":"1","lemma":"노력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노력으로","audio":"/audio/6345ee623aa4fe270c2c.mp3"}},{"text":"큰","meaning":"重，重大，严重","explanation":"크다：重，重大，严重；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"3","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"큰","audio":"/audio/697674905873e8eb4c58.mp3"}},{"text":"행사를","meaning":"活动，仪式，典礼","explanation":"행사：活动，仪式，典礼；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"행사","audio":"/audio/9fbe110d36cda8cf2d98.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72482","senseId":"1","lemma":"행사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"행사를","audio":"/audio/25300fc8d0535d7e5cc2.mp3"}},{"text":"무사히","meaning":"平安无事地，顺利地，无恙地","explanation":"무사히：平安无事地，顺利地，无恙地","readings":[{"term":"무사히","audio":"/audio/232e2bea7145d0ea80a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55619","senseId":"1","lemma":"무사히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무사히","audio":"/audio/232e2bea7145d0ea80a3.mp3"}},{"text":"마칠","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"마치다：结束，完成；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"마치다","audio":"/audio/48af85297dcba6b93058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61135","senseId":"1","lemma":"마치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마칠","audio":"/audio/adee728dbb0221cdb654.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있었어요.","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있었어요","audio":"/audio/7e975037a8edd21f2556.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"29e55caf23ce1fc3","term":"봉사자","zh":"志愿者，义工","audio":"/audio/29e55caf23ce1fc322e5.mp3","entryId":"59872","definition":"不考虑自己的利益、为别人努力做事的人。","pronunciation":["봉ː사자"]},{"id":"09decfebbdb1b0f1","term":"대가","zh":"回报","audio":"/audio/09decfebbdb1b0f10aa7.mp3","entryId":"14261","definition":"对某事付出努力所得的报酬。","pronunciation":["대ː까"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不具有某物，或不具备资格、能力。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"1119b060db74766f","term":"노력","zh":"努力，下工夫","audio":"/audio/1119b060db74766fb336.mp3","entryId":"62400","definition":"为达到某种目的而尽心尽力。","pronunciation":["노력"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"重，重大，严重","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"某事的规模、范围、程度、力量等都超过了一般水平。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"9fbe110d36cda8cf","term":"행사","zh":"活动，仪式，典礼","audio":"/audio/9fbe110d36cda8cf2d98.mp3","entryId":"72482","definition":"有目的或计划地按程序做某事；或指该事。","pronunciation":["행사"]},{"id":"232e2bea7145d0ea","term":"무사히","zh":"平安无事地，顺利地，无恙地","audio":"/audio/232e2bea7145d0ea80a3.mp3","entryId":"55619","definition":"没有任何问题或困难，非常平安地。","pronunciation":["무사히"]},{"id":"48af85297dcba6b9","term":"마치다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/48af85297dcba6b93058.mp3","entryId":"61135","definition":"做的事或过程完结；或指使其完结。","pronunciation":["마치다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/0c484f4765132303f703.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n59872-1-7-2","ko":"참 고마운 분들이군요.","zh":"真是些值得感激的人啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"고마운","meaning":"感谢，感激","explanation":"고맙다：感谢，感激；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"고맙다","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20041","senseId":"1","lemma":"고맙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고마운","audio":"/audio/7956fe99878be1e7f0dd.mp3"}},{"text":"분들이군요.","meaning":"位","explanation":"분：位；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27780","senseId":"1","lemma":"분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분들이군요","audio":"/audio/f3246f29bc47d71142c4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"ded2b4943e89f57d","term":"고맙다","zh":"感谢，感激","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3","entryId":"20041","definition":"因别人为自己做了什么，内心感到很满足，并想给予回报。","pronunciation":["고ː맙따"]},{"id":"ca4a187881dbf529","term":"분","zh":"位","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3","entryId":"27780","definition":"对人的尊称。","pronunciation":["분"]}],"audio":"/audio/88d32700f2fcb4b0407b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.309,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=59872","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":158,"sequenceScore":3.1357,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["真是些值得感激的人啊。","多亏了志愿者们无私的付出，我们才能顺利举办完这场大型活动。","有什么东西正朝船的方向过来吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["多亏了志愿者们无私的付出，我们才能顺利举办完这场大型活动。","有什么东西正朝船的方向过来吗？","真是些值得感激的人啊。"],"answer":2}]}
